      "class": "universal",
      "description": "The art of brewing potions and transmuting materials using magical chemistry. An alchemist gathers exotic ingredients (herbs, crystals, monster parts) and mixes them according to arcane recipes to create useful concoctions. This can produce healing potions, poisons, elixirs of strength, and more. For example, an alchemist might brew a healing draught that knits wounds, or a \u201cflash powder\u201d that creates a bright light. In many RPGs, having the Alchemy skill means you can turn collected herbs into potions \u2013 The Witcher or Skyrim games heavily feature this. Some alchemists even attempt literal transmutation (the classical \u201clead into gold\u201d ambition). While not combat-focused, a prepared alchemist can significantly aid an adventure: a single potion of invisibility or giant\u2019s strength can change the outcome of an encounter.",
